{
  "iri": "https://strandz.it/jigdaw/plugins/drumkit/",
  "label": "DrumKit",
  "comment": "Eleven voice synthesised drum instrument. MIDI notes trigger the voices, the master bus adds crush, drive and room, and per-instrument mutes cut voices immediately.",
  "vendor": "danja",
  "developer": "http://danny.ayers.name",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "registeredName": "drumkit",
  "roles": [
    "trn:Instrument",
    "trn:DrumInstrument"
  ],
  "accepts": [
    "trn:Midi",
    "trn:DrumMidi"
  ],
  "produces": [
    "trn:Audio"
  ],
  "cautions": [
    "One-shot voices: note-offs do nothing, and a hit cannot be choked except the open hat, which a closed hat cuts short.",
    "CC 120 and 123 reset every voice and the master bus, like an all-notes-off.",
    "The eleven trig outputs the native wrapper exposes as UI LEDs are not parameters here and have no panel control."
  ],
  "format": "trn:WebAudio",
  "licenceId": "Apache-2.0",
  "abi": "jig:Abi2",
  "requires": [
    "jig:MidiEvents"
  ],
  "prefers": [],
  "shape": {
    "audioInputs": 0,
    "audioOutputs": 1,
    "outputChannels": 2,
    "renderQuantum": 128,
    "latencyFrames": 0
  },
  "resources": {
    "module": "drumkit.wasm",
    "processor": "drumkit-processor.js"
  },
